    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the dimly lit basement of what appears to be an abandoned intelligence agency outpost. Dust dances in the single beam of moonlight cutting through a high window. Scattered across the desks and workbenches are various obsolete yet highly modified mechanical and digital devices. A heavy steel door blocks your only exit, secured by a complex lock that requires a specific deciphered text. You must interact with the strange assortment of tools, scanners, and terminals to trace the final secret. Be careful—these machines are ingeniously interconnected, and determining the correct sequence of operations is your only chance to escape.",
